# Cynical Loner: "This creature can't be blocked by Glimmers." Bot2's Enduring Vitality (an Elk Glimmer, 3/3) can't block the
# Loner (the refusal) but can block Bot1's Memnite beside it, and Bot2's Memnite (not a Glimmer) can block the Loner. The Loner
# (3/1) and Bot2's Memnite (1/1) kill each other; Bot1's Memnite is killed by Vitality; Bot2 takes no damage (CR 509.1b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Cynical Loner
Memnite
Swamp x3
Swamp x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Enduring Vitality
Memnite
Island x3
Island x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cynical Loner.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#3.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Enduring Vitality.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Cynical Loner > Bot2; Memnite > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Enduring Vitality > Cynical Loner)
Bot2.Block(Enduring Vitality > Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite; Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite > Cynical Loner)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Cynical Loner
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield.Enduring Vitality.Damage = 1
Bot2.Life = 20
